{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>喜歡攝影卻總是覺得拍出來的照片缺乏層次？slay composition guide camera 是一款為攝影初學者及希望提升構圖美感的用戶而設的相機工具，透過即時構圖指引與濾鏡，協助你拍出更具戲劇感和氛圍的影像。目前這款 App 於 App Store 限時免費下載，原價 US $0.99，有需要的讀者把握機會。</p>\n\n<h2>即時構圖指引與美學濾鏡</h2>\n<p>slay 不只是簡單的濾鏡 App，它提供即時構圖指引、構圖課程、美學濾鏡與特效，協助你理解如何拍出更具美感的照片，讓每一個日常瞬間都如電影畫面般充滿故事與氛圍，毋須複雜的後期編輯即可獲得出色效果。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-532-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-533-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-534-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-535-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-536-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-537-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：slay composition guide camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T16:39:03.181163+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}